<paul_adrien_maurice_dirac_work_related_to_albert_einstein> <base.kwebbase.kwconnection.sentence> "That winter, he made his famous improvement on Schrodinger's wave equation, which combined quantum mechanics with Einstein's special theory of relativity." .
